OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed canal to reopen in
OL,4,AMarch, engineers hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FA canal that collapsed in Shropshire is
OL,7,Fexpected to reopen next March, more
OL,8,Fthan a year after two boats fell into
OL,9,Fthe trench when millions of gallons of
OL,10,Fwater rushed out.
OL,12,FA breach in Whitchurch, on 22 December
OL,13,F2025, saw a large section of Llangollen
OL,14,FCanal give way, with a third boat left
OL,15,Fhanging over the edge. The water flowed
OL,16,Finto a nearby field.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
