OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed canal to reopen in
OL,4,AMarch, engineers hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update, the Canal & River Trust
OL,7,Fsaid the canal was "expected to reopen
OL,8,Fahead of Easter, allowing businesses
OL,9,Fand visitors to benefit from the start
OL,10,Fof the main boating and tourism
OL,11,Fseason".
OL,13,FIn January Julie Sharman, chief
OL,14,Foperating officer of the trust, said it
OL,15,Fhad hoped to reopen the canal at the
OL,16,Fend of 2026.
